        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Food Safety: real-time inspection monitor  (REPLAY SIMULATION)\n**The official Chicago dataset is a historical file, not a live feed.** Completed inspections are replayed in date order through Kafka -> Spark Structured Streaming -> ClickHouse at an accelerated speed. All figures below describe the replay, not today's inspections."
      }
